<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali army convoys continue to be ambushed by al-Shabaab near Baidoa, while al-Shabaab suffered heavy losses in Operation Banooda and a Bay operation that reportedly killed 75 fighters. Fitgharan forces now control the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor and Laftagareen forces have seized Buurhakaba and a town in Bay, extending combat in the south. Ethiopia has withdrawn over 3,000 troops and will not intervene in the South West State conflict. US forces have been accused of weaponising floods by trapping women and children in the path of El Niño. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPOUxJOVFBa0FLeVdfTkRsZHMwVlhBU2FJU2xPeHVGTks4aUdQbjdEYlZQR0RNU1lTdHMtNHFPcjQ2OV92VkN5LWRVblk4aTdxQ1RVbFdKX0hkTHVxd1VnRVhEZnR2bTU5clh5U2JhWS1xOXRnTGdzemFHNWFLMU51UlJkM1JLMUt2YmtCUkZDVFU4X05WSHZBb3ZVeEZVbFZqb1NNdDF2Um1JaW5Pbk9UYWRpRXY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQNzM4S1gyZ0paSEFQWmpOLUd6WmZsclZsQ0hsVkNlaE02SjdueENSd2xPOFV6bWRyYmszN2ZFamtSUmh2b2hKUUlNWDB0MFJfX3RnQUFOZVFNMExBZUNWd1U5dHRZLUJkMDdhZlQzMVZldGRlczU4d0JCcHg1NktFcllXTjRDM1BZdU5qQVk2dW5LVE1pMHZ0LTAyTU1uYkhqOWNhYlVzS2I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPc0x4OF8wRmZ1bXpWV0ZQSnYybHJMSF81Q3NFUEVKa0piSzRJQkNGMXl3TmUxQlJZb181ZDZzRGkxVkpia3ZLd0VmQlFxeWNaZ01jYU5EbWQ3ampYeWFuSnpraVBMVzlCQ0hNaXhXSm5yc0d3M2h2NFBVSzR1Tm52dk4wdGNmbGJIVFVBM3lZZUtTdm8wVVBXcThB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQSVk5c1Q3X1BKU0h0dXZJUTNOaVpSR080QkhuOEJFbHYyeWctbTJXYVVKbHpVY0FoZFhNQ2xFRjRKeVdTNmRDbzZOWlQyRHFseGtWXzd2ZHM3amxGcjl3ZWpTYnNHTjhzOEdtYW5EVlo4TDZySkNiSGtTNGUxZzJqc1A3ZDdJY1Ztc1p3